  "ruleText": "He-P 1903.01 Inquiries. Inquiries regarding the Act, He-P 1900, and registering complaints shall be made to the Tobacco Prevention and Cessation Program at 1-800-852-3345, ext. 8949, or electronically at: https://www.dhhs.nh.gov/dphs/tobacco/indoor.htm.\n\nSource. #5759, eff 12-20-93; ss by #7172, eff 12-21-99, EXPIRED: 12-21-07\n\nNew. #9054, eff 12-29-07, EXPIRED: 12-29-15\n\nNew. #12534, INTERIM, eff 5-24-18, EXPIRES: 11-20-18; ss by #12677, eff 11-20-18",
